claim.claim-text:
(a) an elongate device body comprising:
(i) a first motor disposed within the elongate device body;
(ii) a first driveshaft operably coupled to the first motor and to a first lower gear; and
(iii) a second motor disposed within the elongate device body and substantially coaxially with the first motor, the second motor operably coupled to a first upper gear;

(a) a third motor disposed within the elongate device body;
(b) a second driveshaft operably coupled to the third motor and to a second lower gear;
(c) a fourth motor disposed within the elongate device body and substantially coaxially with the third motor, the fourth motor operably coupled to a second upper gear;
(d) a second shoulder joint comprising a second output shaft operably coupled to a second output gear, wherein the second output gear is operably coupled to the second upper and second lower gears; and
(e) a second arm operably coupled to the second shoulder joint.

(i) a third motor;
(ii) a second driveshaft rotatably coupled to the third motor; and
(iii) a fourth motor disposed substantially coaxially with the third motor.
